            {
                "comment": "The class average is a BC right now and he doesn't want to curve the class. I would recommend taking it with someone else if you care about your GPA. The exams are nearly impossible for students to finish in time and with his original homework submissions you spent more time formatting your homework for him than on the actual heat transfer part.",
